CRITERION 3 -- attempt-3 change: an accurate 400 message for EVERY ValidatePersons / start_date error class: FAIL
  Enumerated from prepare/validate.go:21-80 + models.ParseYearMonth (whatif.go:236-245), each POSTed directly to bin-base and
